# Testing

## Commands

```bash
flutter test                              # all tests
flutter test test/tajweed_baqarah_test.dart
flutter test --exclude-tags golden        # what CI runs
flutter test --update-goldens             # regenerate golden PNGs
dart format --output=none --set-exit-if-changed lib test tools
flutter analyze
```

All four must pass before a change is considered done. CI runs format, analyze, and
`flutter test --exclude-tags golden`.

